layers "The OSI model" numbered=reverse
  Application : what the user's software speaks
    HTTP
    DNS
    SMTP
  Presentation : encoding, encryption, compression
    TLS
    JPEG
  Session : opening and closing conversations
  Transport : reliable delivery between hosts
    TCP
    UDP
  Network : routing across networks
    IP
    ICMP
  Data link : frames between neighbours
    Ethernet
    Wi-Fi
  Physical : bits on a wire, fibre or air
